{
  "format": "complete-a-commitment/1",
  "module": {
    "id": "restaurant-staffing-learning-operations",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "title": "Complete a restaurant staffing test and response",
    "template": {
      "id": "complete-a-commitment",
      "version": 1
    },
    "question": "Can this complete learning option and later staffing response operate within the declared time, people and spending limits?",
    "description": "Compare six complete learning-and-response plans across both admitted outcomes before comparing the value of information.",
    "units": {
      "time": "minute",
      "timeOrigin": "2026-11-13T00:00:00-06:00",
      "money": "USD cent",
      "count": "dinner or paid work-hour"
    },
    "assumptions": [
      "The four fixed dinner starts are November 13, 20, 27 and December 4, 2026 at 18:00. The declared serviceHours applies to all four; the three-hour example ends at 21:00.",
      "A trial observes every dinner and hires the extra runner for November 20 and December 4. Observation is continuous work requiring a separate person while the host station remains covered.",
      "Unassigned allocation resources are inactive placeholders for contexts that do not conduct the trial. They have zero payroll and never use an operating person. Every real activity resource demand is one whole person.",
      "The trial price is derived from the same four observation allocations and two runner allocations, their shared serviceHours and the accepted hourly rates. No independent trial quote is substituted.",
      "The audit is a complete accepted flat fee. The budget is authority to spend on learning; it is not available cash and does not fund hypothetical future wages.",
      "The per-dinner upside and downside are incremental NET monetary outcomes for the future runner setup, already including future runner wages. Usual staffing has zero incremental payoff. Learning fees are separate and counted once.",
      "November 13 at noon as the starting time, a two-hour audit, December 5 at 21:00 as trial answer time and December 7 at noon as the decision deadline are explicit additional fictional timing premises, not dates claimed from the source document.",
      "When an actual report arrives, reassess only future choices with currentTime equal to its actual receipt time and futureDinnerCount equal to the remaining horizon. The no-study context does not recharge a sunk study fee.",
      "Every choice is checked under both admitted outcomes. A probability or favorable report never waives the operational conditions. This assessment does not hire anyone, purchase a study or publish a roster."
    ],
    "inputs": {
      "parameters": {
        "futureDinnerCount": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "count",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "runnerHourlyRateMinor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "money",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "observerHourlyRateMinor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "money",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "serviceHours": {
          "type": "integer",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "observerIsHost": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "trialPriceComplete": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "auditPriceComplete": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "auditFeeMinor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "money",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "studyBudgetMinor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "money",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "currentTime": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "time",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "decisionDeadline": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "time",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "auditDuration": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "time",
          "minimum": 0,
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "trialAnswerTime": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "time",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "runnerAvailable": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "upsidePerDinnerMinor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "money",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "downsidePerDinnerMinor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "unit": "money",
          "maximum": 0
        }
      },
      "tables": {
        "_studyFactors": {
          "key": [
            "id"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "no-study",
                "audit",
                "trial"
              ]
            },
            "auditCount": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "enum": [
                0,
                1
              ]
            },
            "trialCount": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "enum": [
                0,
                1
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "_responseFactors": {
          "key": [
            "id"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "usual",
                "runner"
              ]
            },
            "runnerCount": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "enum": [
                0,
                1
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "_observerAssignments": {
          "key": [
            "study",
            "observerIsHost"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "study": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "no-study",
                "audit",
                "trial"
              ]
            },
            "observerIsHost": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "resource": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "host",
                "observer",
                "runner",
                "unassigned-observation",
                "unassigned-runner"
              ],
              "references": {
                "table": "_resources",
                "column": "id"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "_runnerAssignments": {
          "key": [
            "id"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "no-study",
                "audit",
                "trial"
              ]
            },
            "resource": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "host",
                "observer",
                "runner",
                "unassigned-observation",
                "unassigned-runner"
              ],
              "references": {
                "table": "_resources",
                "column": "id"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "_resources": {
          "key": [
            "id"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "host",
                "observer",
                "runner",
                "unassigned-observation",
                "unassigned-runner"
              ]
            },
            "capacity": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "enum": [
                1
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "_booleans": {
          "key": [
            "flag"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "flag": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "count": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "enum": [
                0,
                1
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "scenarios": {
          "key": [
            "id"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "worthwhile",
                "not-worthwhile"
              ]
            },
            "upsideCount": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "enum": [
                0,
                1
              ]
            },
            "downsideCount": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "enum": [
                0,
                1
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "bookings": {
          "key": [
            "id"
          ],
          "columns": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "resource": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "host",
                "observer",
                "runner",
                "unassigned-observation",
                "unassigned-runner"
              ],
              "references": {
                "table": "_resources",
                "column": "id"
              }
            },
            "from": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "time",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "through": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "time",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "amount": {
              "type": "integer",
              "unit": "count",
              "minimum": 0,
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "study",
        "domain": {
          "values": [
            "no-study",
            "audit",
            "trial"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "response",
        "domain": {
          "values": [
            "usual",
            "runner"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "scenarioDomain": {
      "table": "scenarios"
    },
    "lookupCoverage": [
      {
        "table": "_studyFactors",
        "keys": {
          "id": {
            "domain": {
              "values": [
                "no-study",
